\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Network Ports (Figure~\ref{fig:m2_ports}):} Verified virtual port allocations, including DHCP agent ports and router gateway endpoints.
    \item \textbf{Horizon Topology Graph (Figure~\ref{fig:m2_topology_diagram}):} The interactive topology visualization displays the multi-tier segmentation: external traffic enters through \texttt{public}, traverses \texttt{m2-router}, and fans out to the DMZ (red) and Private (green) networks.
\end{itemize}

